      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but it feels a little bit generic. My boss is actually worried that the \"Cons\" section is being a bit too surface-level and essentially downplaying the actual severity of the impact on the manufacturing sector. \n\nCould you expand on the cons? I need more detail on the specific economic risks and the potential for industry pushback. Also, try to make sure the language is very precise so the sentiment score doesn't accidentally skew positive just because of the \"Pros\" section being long. I really need the nuance on the negative impacts to be clear.",
